Omission
- [N1] Node-level omission: i6:we reject the invoice. (reason: This distinct step was not faithfully implemented as an independent action with proper granularity.)
- [N2] Node-level omission: i7:If the invoice is rejected, we return it to the client (reason: This independent step and its conditional qualifier were not faithfully implemented in the model.)

Mutation
- [N3] Node-level mutation: element=action(n6,"Reject invoice and return to client"); source=i6:we reject the invoice. -> i7:If the invoice is rejected, we return it to the client; reason=The element improperly merges two distinct source steps into a single action, losing the granularity of the separate tasks and completely dropping the explicit conditional qualifier 'If the invoice is rejected'.
